---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kissimmee Vacation Rental Refresh Guide | Go Pro"
  description="Paint, trim, TV mounting, and murals for Kissimmee vacation rentals near Disney. What a refresh includes, timing, and ROI on cosmetic upgrades."
  ogImage="/images/bedroom-paint.jpg"
  schema={{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "Article",
        "@id": "https://goprohomeimprovements.com/guides/kissimmee-vacation-rental-refresh/#article",
        "headline": "Kissimmee Vacation Rental Refresh Guide",
        "description": "Complete guide to refreshing vacation rentals near Disney with paint, trim, TV mounting, and themed rooms.",
        "author": {
          "@type": "Organization",
          "name": "GO PRO HOME IMPROVEMENTS INC."
        },
        "publisher": {
          "@type": "Organization",
          "name": "GO PRO HOME IMPROVEMENTS INC.",
          "logo": {
            "@type": "ImageObject",
            "url": "https://goprohomeimprovements.com/images/logo.png"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "@id": "https://goprohomeimprovements.com/guides/kissimmee-vacation-rental-refresh/#breadcrumbs",
        "itemListElement": [
          {
            "@type": "ListItem",
            "position": 1,
            "name": "Home",
            "item": "https://goprohomeimprovements.com"
          },
          {
            "@type": "ListItem",
            "position": 2,
            "name": "Guides",
            "item": "https://goprohomeimprovements.com/guides"
          },
          {
            "@type": "ListItem",
            "position": 3,
            "name": "Vacation Rental Refresh",
            "item": "https://goprohomeimprovements.com/guides/kissimmee-vacation-rental-refresh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }}
>
  <Header />

  <section class="bg-gopro-charcoal text-white py-16 border-b-4 border-gopro-orange">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <nav class="text-sm mb-6 font-sans">
        <a href="/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gopro-orange transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500">/</span>
        <a href="/guides" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gopro-orange transition-colors">Guides</a>
        <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500">/</span>
        <span class="text-white">Vacation Rental Refresh</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-black uppercase mb-4 tracking-tight">Kissimmee Vacation Rental Refresh Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl font-sans">
        Paint, trim, TV mounting, and themed rooms for STRs near Disney. What a refresh includes and why it matters.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            Vacation rentals around <a href="/areas/kissimmee" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">Kissimmee</a>, <a href="/areas/celebration" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">Celebration</a>, and <a href="/areas/poinciana" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">Poinciana</a> compete hard for bookings. Fresh paint, upgraded trim, mounted TVs in bedrooms, and themed kids' rooms stand out in listing photos—and the owners who refresh every 3-5 years stay booked while dated properties sit empty.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-black uppercase mb-6 tracking-tight mt-12">Why Refresh?</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Guest turnover beats up interiors. Scuffed walls, worn trim, builder-beige paint, and old TVs on furniture make a property look tired. A refresh isn't a full remodel—it's targeted cosmetic upgrades that show well in photos and cost a fraction of what you'd spend renovating kitchens or bathrooms.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Most Kissimmee vacation rental owners refresh every 3-5 years. The ones near Disney with themed rooms and modern finishes charge $50-$100 more per night and stay at 80%+ occupancy. The ones that skip the refresh compete on price and lose bookings to newer inventory.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-black uppercase mb-6 tracking-tight mt-12">What a Typical Refresh Includes</h2>
          
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-4 tracking-wide mt-8">1. Fresh Interior Paint</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Repaint common areas and high-traffic bedrooms. Neutral grays and whites make spaces feel clean and modern. Some owners add an accent wall in the living room or master bedroom. We see a lot of navy, charcoal, or sage green. <a href="/services/interior-exterior-painting" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">Interior painting</a> is the single highest ROI upgrade for a vacation rental.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-4 tracking-wide mt-8">2. Themed Kids' Rooms</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Disney-area rentals with themed kids' bedrooms book faster. Popular themes: Star Wars, Harry Potter, Frozen, Finding Nemo, Toy Story. We paint the walls, add <a href="/services/murals" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">hand-painted murals</a> or vinyl decals, and install themed lighting or <a href="/services/trim-crown-molding" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">trim details</a>. The room becomes a photo magnet for listing sites and social media.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-4 tracking-wide mt-8">3. TV Mounting in Every Bedroom</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Guests expect <a href="/services/tv-mounting" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">wall-mounted TVs</a> in bedrooms, not TVs on dressers. Mounting frees up furniture space, looks cleaner in photos, and prevents damage from kids knocking TVs over. We mount TVs, hide wires in-wall or with cable channels, and set up streaming apps so guests check in and start watching immediately.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-4 tracking-wide mt-8">4. Upgraded Trim & Crown Molding</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Many Kissimmee rentals are tract homes built with minimal trim. Adding <a href="/services/trim-crown-molding" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">crown molding</a> in living rooms, dining rooms, and master bedrooms gives the space an upscale look that shows in listing photos. Costs $800-$2,000 per room depending on size. Not essential, but it differentiates higher-end properties.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-4 tracking-wide mt-8">5. Pool Area & Exterior Touch-Ups</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            <a href="/services/power-washing" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">Power wash</a> the pool deck, driveway, and exterior walls. Touch up exterior paint on trim and front door. Clean exteriors photograph better and guests notice curb appeal when they pull up. A clean exterior makes them feel the whole property is well-maintained.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-gopro-orange/10 border-l-4 border-gopro-orange p-6 my-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-2 tracking-wide">Typical Refresh Budget</h3>
            <ul class="text-gray-700 font-sans space-y-2 mb-0">
              <li><strong>Basic Refresh (paint only):</strong> $2,500-$5,000</li>
              <li><strong>Mid-Level (paint + TV mounting + power wash):</strong> $5,000-$8,000</li>
              <li><strong>Full Refresh (paint, TVs, themed rooms, trim, power wash):</strong> $10,000-$15,000</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-black uppercase mb-6 tracking-tight mt-12">Timing the Refresh</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Most owners refresh during low season (September-November or late April-May) when bookings drop and vacancy won't cost as much. The work typically takes 7-14 days depending on scope. Schedule during a gap between reservations, or block out two weeks and eat the lost revenue—you'll make it back with higher nightly rates and better occupancy.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-black uppercase mb-6 tracking-tight mt-12">ROI on Vacation Rental Upgrades</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Fresh paint and themed rooms let you raise nightly rates $30-$75 without losing bookings. A $10,000 refresh pays back in 6-12 months if you reprice correctly and update your listing photos. The properties that don't refresh stay stuck at lower rates and compete with older inventory.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Kissimmee and Celebration vacation rental owners who refresh regularly (every 3-5 years) maintain 5-star reviews, charge premium rates, and ride out slow seasons better than owners who let properties age.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-black uppercase mb-6 tracking-tight mt-12">Common Questions</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
            <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-gopro-orange p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-2 tracking-wide">Should I do a full refresh or just paint?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 font-sans mb-0">
                Depends on your current occupancy rate and nightly price. If you're booked solid and charging top dollar, paint may be enough. If bookings are slow or guests mention dated decor in reviews, invest in themed rooms and TV upgrades to compete.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-gopro-orange p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-2 tracking-wide">Do themed rooms really increase bookings?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 font-sans mb-0">
                Yes. Families with kids actively search for themed rooms. A well-done Star Wars or Frozen room becomes the main photo in your listing and gets shared on social media. It's the difference between "another pool home" and "the house with the awesome kids' rooms."
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-gopro-orange p-6">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-2 tracking-wide">How long does a refresh take?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 font-sans mb-0">
                Paint-only refresh: 3-5 days. Full refresh with themed rooms, trim, and TV mounting: 7-14 days depending on the number of rooms and whether we're working around furniture or an empty house.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-black uppercase mb-6 tracking-tight mt-12">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 font-sans">
            Vacation rentals are a visual business. Guests scroll through 20+ properties before booking, and fresh interiors win. A targeted refresh every 3-5 years keeps your Kissimmee rental competitive, justifies higher rates, and pays for itself within a year through better occupancy and pricing power.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 my-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase mb-4 tracking-wide">Own a Vacation Rental Near Disney?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 font-sans mb-6">
              We refresh Kissimmee, Celebration, and Orlando-area vacation rentals. Paint, themed rooms, TV mounting, trim, power washing. Work fast so your property isn't vacant long.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
              <a href="/estimate" class="btn-primary">
                Get Free Estimate
              </a>
              <a href="tel:4072446873" class="btn-secondary">
                Call (407) 244-6873
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 font-sans">
              <a href="/guides" class="text-gopro-orange hover:underline">← Back to All Guides</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    title="Ready to Refresh Your Vacation Rental?"
    description="Fresh paint, themed rooms, and upgrades that boost bookings. Serving Kissimmee & Central Florida."
  />

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
